  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I am trying to film Machinimas in VRChat and we are using Desktop. When I'm the host and I move my mouse around, my character looks good with appropriate speed and snappiness but when I see other people move their mouse, the interpolation smoothens out the movements way too much. It doesn't accurately portray the speed of the other player's mouse and the performance of the player is lost. Makes it impossible to film a machinima using desktop. I want to be able to see the movements in realtime with actual accuracy. Please make a disable interpolation feature so that other player's accurate mouse movements can be seen.",
